ALVA — Complete UI consistency, typography, hover and dialogue overhaul

Objective

Perform a comprehensive, game-wide UI consistency and bug-fixing update for ALVA.

Repository: https://github.com/hiyroscript/alva

The objective is to establish a consistent, polished interface across every screen, menu, dialogue, and gameplay overlay.

This is an implementation task, not merely a review. Inspect the existing architecture, make the necessary code changes, update tests, and verify the results.

There are five major requirements:

1. Correct capitalization and sentence casing throughout the game.
2. Eliminate unintended button hover, focus, and preselection effects.
3. Standardize every dialogue using the Controller connections dialogue’s semi-transparent glass appearance.
4. Give all rectangular menu buttons the same corners as the Home Play button.
5. Fix dialogue layering so newer dialogues always appear above the dialogues that opened them.

All five requirements must be applied consistently and verified across the entire game.

