The English localization contains several title-cased strings, including result.changeStage, practice.changeFighter, pause.restart, and the match-result winner labels. These must be reviewed.

Ensure French remains grammatically correct and follows normal French capitalization conventions.

Do not break interpolation placeholders, translation keys, formatting logic, or dynamically generated descriptions.

CSS capitalization

Audit all stylesheets for:

