3. Standardize the glass appearance of every dialogue

Reference design

Use the existing Controller connections dialogue as the canonical visual reference.

Relevant files:

* js/ui/controller-dialog.js
* css/controller.css
* css/battle.css
* css/base.css

The reference panel uses the existing shared classes:

