The shared glass system already provides translucent charcoal surfaces, subtle highlights, borders, shadows, and backdrop blur where available.

The corresponding glass variables are defined in css/base.css, and .glass / .glass--panel are implemented in css/battle.css.

Reuse and standardize this system rather than creating another independent glass design.

